<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank drains 2 bln Skr from the market.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank drains 2 bln Skr from the market.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday it drained two billion crowns from the market in its weekly reverse repurchase operation.</p>
<p>The reverse repo was set at an unchanged fixed rate of 4.10 percent and will run from April 9 to 16, replacing an operation that drained 3.5 billion crowns from the market.</p>
<p>The Riksbank said 0.46 percent of the bids for the tender were allocated.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
